        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, production mix CH</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, production mix CH
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for the year 2019.; UUID:50d4ab1d-354a-302a-9de7-9e1410783092
Included are the shares of domestic electricity production by technology at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Switzerland.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_50d4ab1d-354a-302a-9de7-9e1410783092.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
